sequenceDiagram
    actor Doctor
    participant MVC as GummySmileController
    participant Svc as GummySmileCaseService
    participant API as GummySmileApiService
    participant Cloud as Gummy Smile API
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Doctor->>MVC: Start(patientId)
    MVC->>MVC: CanAccessPatientAsync
    MVC->>Svc: StartCaseAsync(patientId)
    Svc->>API: CreateCaseAsync()
    API->>Cloud: POST api/cases
    Cloud-->>API: GsCaseDto
    Svc->>DB: INSERT GummySmileCase
    MVC-->>Doctor: Redirect Upload

    Doctor->>MVC: POST Upload rest + smile images
    MVC->>Svc: UploadImagesAsync()
    Svc->>API: UploadImageAsync(rest)
    API->>Cloud: POST images role=rest
    Svc->>API: UploadImageAsync(smile)
    API->>Cloud: POST images role=smile
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE image bytes
    MVC-->>Doctor: Redirect Analyze

    Doctor->>MVC: POST Analyze
    MVC->>Svc: RunAnalysisAsync()
    Svc->>API: AnalyzeAsync()
    API->>Cloud: POST api/cases/id/analyze
    Cloud-->>API: AI measurements and overlays
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE CaseSnapshotJson
    MVC-->>Doctor: Review page

    Doctor->>MVC: POST Review overrides
    MVC->>Svc: SaveOverridesAsync()
    Svc->>API: UpdateOverridesAsync()
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE OverridesRequestJson

    Doctor->>MVC: POST Clinical data
    MVC->>Svc: SubmitClinicalAsync()
    Svc->>API: UpdateClinicalAsync()
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE ClinicalRequestJson

    Doctor->>MVC: Diagnosis then Treatment
    MVC->>Svc: FinalizeCaseAsync()
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE DiagnosisSummary Severity CompletedAt

    Doctor->>MVC: DownloadPdf
    MVC->>Svc: GetReportPdfAsync()
    Svc->>API: GET api/cases/id/report.pdf
    API->>Cloud: Fetch PDF
    Cloud-->>Doctor: PDF download
